            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.13109/prkk.2017.66.2.88</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>&quot;Pro Ana&quot;: Psychodynamic References for Anorexia Nervosa The internet-based phenomenon &quot;Pro Ana&quot; refers to the eating disorder anorexia nervosa in a positive way. To understand what the phenomenon &quot;Pro Ana&quot; represents, the websites are used as a starting point of the current analysis. Based on these results, similarities and differences between &quot;Pro Ana&quot; and the eating disorder anorexia nervosa are discussed. Furthermore psychodynamic references for anorexia nervosa are derived and finally their importance for treatment motivation will be considered.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
